 opera focusing on social issues and young love. Nixon unsuccessfully attempted to sell the series to NBC ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erica_Kane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... She has no voice within the narrative and is described only by her effect on the characters around her. In the series, the character of Irene is far more complex and the viewer is able to form a more personal relationship with the character and more readily sympathise ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Forsyte_Saga_(2002_TV_series)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Saturdays opposite the popular NBC series, Your Hit Parade. Midway through the season, an attempt was made to increase ratings by having Havoc's character relocate to New York to represent show business clients; however, the show lasted only one season.\\\"Lady Lawyer Practices Law,\\\" TV Guide ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_Havoc\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... attempts to connect with her long-lost grandmother by cooking through the family cookbook.\\n\\n- Two separate families become one after a marriage unites them.\\n\\n- A character sets out to sail the river from one end of their country to other.\\n\\n- A character becomes the mayor of a new ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.emwelsh.com/blog/story-ideas\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... in film and TV ever since, appearing on Aidy Bryant's Hulu series Shrill and in the 2019 film James vs. His Future Self. In 2023, he joined season 4 of Apple TV+'s critically acclaimed science fiction drama For All Mankind as the character Eli Hobson.\\n\\nHe ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... Most recently, Liotta appeared in The Many Saints of Newark, Marriage Story and No Sudden Move. He also appeared on Jennifer Lopez's TV show, Shades of Blue, which ended after three seasons. Liotta is survived by his daughter, Karsen and his fiancée Jacy Nittolo.\\n\\nJohn Zderko\\n\\nThe ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.etonline.com/gallery/stars-weve-lost-in-2022-177426\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... His wife and three children survive him, as do three grandchildren.- Actor\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nHenry Gibson was born on 21 September 1935 in Germantown, Pennsylvania. Before appearing in films and television series, he was a child star on the stage during the 1940s and during the late 1950s he ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2009&ref_=nm_ov_dth_year\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d38\"},\"ref\":\"d38\",\"snippet\":\" ... Frasier Winslow Crane (born ) is a fictional character who is both a supporting character on the American television sitcom Cheers and the titular protagonist of its spin-off Frasier and the latter's 2023 sequel. In all three series, he is portrayed by Kelsey Grammer. The character debuted ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frasier_Crane\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"ee3ba4cc39154ffe9c08ebe5873d66b199e2e8546108b3a8e18af3be1b0ab0a1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"35c11a9289c90c5a186c59a579ac9a07a66f12de1c05f6da9a8d57a1f9bafe3f\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"long running TV series character three marriages one surviving child\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d222\"},\"ref\":\"d222\",\"snippet\":\" ... Rube does not appear (he reportedly had moved on), but is mentioned by the characters; the new leader of the reapers is Cameron Kane, played by Henry Ian Cusick.\\n\\nSoundtrack\\n\\nLa-La Land Records released a soundtrack containing the original score to the series composed by Stewart Copeland ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_Like_Me\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... Along with the marriages, the character is also given a number of other love interests. The motivation behind the multiple romances stems from the character's need to fill the void her father left when he abandoned her.\\n\\nAs the series begins, Erica's romantic role is as ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erica_Kane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d223\"},\"ref\":\"d223\",\"snippet\":\" ... two into one coherent character so convincingly.<\\\\/p>\\\\n\\n\\nStructurally, \\\"Poor Things\\\" is a coming-of-age story on meth. Bella is forced to speed